--[[
================================================================================
SERVER FINDER & HOPPER WITH RANDOM INDEX & DYNAMIC CLAIM SCANNING
================================================================================
Updates Enforced:
1. Random Page Index (0-299) when requesting Roblox public server pages.
2. Target candidate server player range strictly forced to 1-3 players.
3. Queue Guard: Ignores servers that have queued/in-line joining players.
4. Selection Pool: Gathers valid candidates, isolates 5 random choices, and picks 1.
5. Infinite Hop Loop: Continuously scans until a valid target server is found.
6. Dynamic Re-claiming: Continuously checks claims—if a claim holder leaves, 
   the script immediately claims ownership for LocalPlayer.
================================================================================
]]

